    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8e3d5ccbf08c4a843a37ca4236ea51f5, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Is SHE going to behave?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
